window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>There is a vampire in the night...ready to destroy the lives of Vanora Socoli and her older siblings. His ancient hunger and great evil will forever change their lives. </p> <p>There is a vampire in the night...waiting to fulfill an ancient prophecy and conquer the world. But first, he must wait for the right moment to finally reveal himself to the young woman he believes is his right to claim: Vanora. </p> <p>There is a vampire in the night...who catches Vanora’s eye and captures her heart. Yet, can she trust him? For her enemy has enveloped her in a web of deceit, casting doubt on all she believes to be true. </p>"; 
